:"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","name":"The Speakers","description":"The Closing, 2387. The elected voices of Lantern's indentured crews: Wick, pumps, stills, farms, docks. Not a union the Company recognises.","color":"#f97316","coverImageId":null,"tags":[],"id":"dIEAcgdp1bcw0KzkCckPE","createdAt":1793146717447,"updatedAt":1793146808388,"version":2},{"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","name":"The Salt","description":"The Owing, 311 AC. Smugglers who run ice off Caul outside the Tally and trade in brass washers. Based in the old ice docks.","color":"#14b8a6","coverImageId":null,"tags":[],"id":"fAmyEkSeUAdcdWPIkN6EY","createdAt":1793146722766,"updatedAt":1793146821772,"version":2},{"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","name":"The Good Title's crew","description":"The Healing, 3089 CE. Mabry Ode's people. Throat-runners.","color":"#ec4899","coverImageId":null,"tags":[],"id":"jhjr7tzIjP-KNWkuxA4gA","createdAt":1793146728083,"updatedAt":1793146833547,"version":2},{"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","name":"Company Security","description":"The Closing, 2387. The Company's armed men on Lantern, ex-marines most of them. They sealed Caul Deep.","color":"#eab308","coverImageId":null,"tags":[],"id":"mNHlftQ13Dn1dNx3evd94","createdAt":1793146719214,"updatedAt":1793146812854,"version":2},{"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","name":"The Halden-Ash Company","description":"The Closing, 2387. The chartered company that opened the Sabra Concern in 2296 and owns Lantern, its air, its water, and its people's contracts. Withdrawing as the Throat closes.","color":"#ef4444","coverImageId":null,"tags":[],"id":"tDq4uex-lPhI2ed7FgDno","createdAt":1793146715682,"updatedAt":1793146803885,"version":3},{"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","name":"Brightwater Recovery","description":"The Healing, 3089 CE. A Concord lien-house. Bought the Halden-Ash Sabra Concern receivables eleven years before the Throat healed.","color":"#8b5cf6","coverImageId":null,"tags":[],"id":"wjNl7B17DNZ7A3K8Ad7kv","createdAt":1793146726309,"updatedAt":1793146827503,"version":2}],"factionMemberships":[{"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","factionId":"jhjr7tzIjP-KNWkuxA4gA","characterId":"QFvVlO7B_a1YmFMbnd84l","role":null,"startEventId":null,"endEventId":null,"notes":"","id":"3_0ehzJPS2dMDIiBtMBd8","createdAt":1793146836522,"updatedAt":1793146836522,"version":1},{"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","factionId":"dIEAcgdp1bcw0KzkCckPE","characterId":"g_pQemPTYKrSyuBXSXecB","role":null,"startEventId":null,"endEventId":null,"notes":"","id":"89fXxosNrglon9hTjc21n","createdAt":1793146811372,"updatedAt":1793146811372,"version":1},{"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","factionId":"tDq4uex-lPhI2ed7FgDno","characterId":"B5N-ORRxzDAoRSjwt4RPw","role":null,"startEventId":null,"endEventId":null,"notes":"","id":"AK2bADZ_TthA8Dc_z1QZp","createdAt":1793146805305,"updatedAt":1793146805305,"version":1},{"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","factionId":"fAmyEkSeUAdcdWPIkN6EY","characterId":"4DB-SYsFxGhwQg_T_P6Tr","role":null,"startEventId":null,"endEventId":null,"notes":"","id":"ByYpZefWJybBGah-3cTxN","createdAt":1793146823170,"updatedAt":1793146823170,"version":1},{"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","factionId":"wjNl7B17DNZ7A3K8Ad7kv","characterId":"EEp34P_LIwiHnQUS72F_S","role":null,"startEventId":null,"endEventId":null,"notes":"","id":"MiOLzd4kBvkdMAngbKyo8","createdAt":1793146830488,"updatedAt":1793146830488,"version":1},{"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","factionId":"tDq4uex-lPhI2ed7FgDno","characterId":"4PJK2irFlLq0lPkroCgPG","role":null,"startEventId":null,"endEventId":null,"notes":"","id":"UkZ4XrdRupQ-040Rgojrk","createdAt":1793146806904,"updatedAt":1793146806904,"version":1},{"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","factionId":"HlqYGueXW8Bnkd8EA-86r","characterId":"U8Xy6zAdXRBSS6PGWXunZ","role":null,"startEventId":null,"endEventId":null,"notes":"","id":"VywOwMJMl-ZCAF776K0Wy","createdAt":1793146826020,"updatedAt":1793146826020,"version":1},{"worldId":"p5RB-gewXUZYlHUKTH5pw","factionId":"DSVxaAh1hdIKuAeHmtfvI","characterId":"D